<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Prometheus</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        
        header {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        
        header h1 {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        header p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        
        section {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        
        h2 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .screenshot {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            height: auto;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .feature {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        .feature h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .tech-stack {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        
        .tech-badge {
            background: #3498db;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        
        .links {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            margin-right: 1rem;
            background: #3498db;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            background: #2980b9;
        }
        
        footer {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Prometheus</h1>
        <p>Heliostat Simulation and Optimization Strategies</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <section id="overview">
            <h2>Overview</h2>
            <p>A solar power tower plant is an energy plant that uses a field of mirrors to direct sunlight to generate power. A molten salt is pumped through a
            central reciever while being irradiated to generate power. The central control problem is how to optimize the heliostat aiming strategy to maximize
            power output and reciever lifetime. Current methods are lacking in several important areas. The goal of my work is to develop better aiming strategies
            to improve plant performance.</p>
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x400/3498db/ffffff?text=Main+Screenshot" alt="Project screenshot" class="screenshot">
        </section>

        <section id="features">
            <h2>Key Features</h2>
            <div class="features">
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Feature 1</h3>
                    <p>Description of the first key feature</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Feature 2</h3>
                    <p>Description of the second key feature</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Feature 3</h3>
                    <p>Description of the third key feature</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="demo">
            <h2>Transient Cloud Modeling</h2>
            <img src="halos_transient_flux.gif" alt="Animated demonstration">
            <p>This animation shows the results of a simulation I created that models total flux on a reciever as a cloud passes over the field.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="tech">
            <h2>Technologies Used</h2>
            <div class="tech-stack">
                <span class="tech-badge">HTML</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">CSS</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">JavaScript</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">React</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Node.js</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="links">
            <h2>Links</h2>
            <div class="links">
                <a href="#" class="btn">Live Demo</a>
                <a href="#" class="btn">GitHub Repository</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2024 Your Name. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
